2、项目根目录 styles.css（实现彩色框样式，复刻KaTeX网页版视觉）
放在项目根目录，和_quarto.yml同级 ```css @import url(‘https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600;700&display=swap’);
body { font-family: “Source Sans 3”, system-ui, sans-serif; color:#222; }
/* 定义框：蓝色左边框 */ .def-box { background-color:#f0f4f8; border-left:4px solid #4472c4; padding:1rem 1.2rem; margin:1.4rem 0; border-radius:4px; }
/* 历史备注：金色边框 */ .history-note { background:#fff8e6; border-left:4px solid #edb144; padding:0.9rem 1.2rem; margin:1.4rem 0; border-radius:4px; }
/* 深色总结块 */ .takeaway-box { background:#2b3a55; color:#ffffff; padding:1.3rem 1.4rem; margin-top:2rem; border-radius:6px; } .takeaway-box h3, .takeaway-box h4 { color:#ffffff; }
